      "description": "RUNG 5 — FINAL Stage-1 task (overnight chain, runs last, on the NEW expandable backbone; warm-starts IN-MEMORY from rung 4. New checkpoint: models/ppo_jal_expandable/stage1_9_complete.pt). HOME-SPOT APPROACH → TURN → KICK: final Stage 1 task. Robot starts at its fixed home pose (-10, 0) facing a random heading; ball spawns at full distribution (x∈[5,30], y∈[-15,15]). Must approach 15–43 units (approach_ball enabled for the first time), turn to aim, then kick. goto and dribbles stay disabled — Gaussian Dx/Dy head still idle, only Dtheta active. approach_weight=1.0 (not 1.8): worst-case park EV = 1.0×43−10 = 33 << goal 70; at 1.8 it would be 67≈goal (unsafe local optimum). Acceptance: goal ≥ 50% over final 1000 eps; no primitive > 90% in any 100-ep window. Warm-start: models/ppo_jal_curriculum/stage1_180_y15_complete.pt. Budget: 300,000 steps — first stage with genuine approach learning, not an instant transfer.",
